WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.060
Chief of staff May hold a wider organisational or

00:00:04.113 --> 00:00:08.665
strategic mandate Access to the executive does not confer

00:00:08.731 --> 00:00:11.876
this mandate on an EA Conveying approved wording is

00:00:11.942 --> 00:00:14.152
different from negotiating a commitment
